### ===================================
### Pronunciation API Tests
### Base Path: /api/word/pronunciation
### ===================================

### Get Pronunciation by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/pronunciation/1

###

### Get Pronunciations by Word ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/pronunciation/word/1

###

### Get Pronunciations by Character ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/pronunciation/character/1

###

### Download Pronunciation Audio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/pronunciation/download/1
